$comment
ERROR EXAMPLE: Job runs but is killed by the queue/wallclock before
finishing. The input itself is fine — submit with an artificially short
walltime to trigger an incomplete output (no normal-termination message).
$end

$molecule
0 1
H    1.8853  -0.0401   1.0854
C    1.2699  -0.0477   0.1772
H    1.5840   0.8007  -0.4449
H    1.5089  -0.9636  -0.3791
C   -0.2033   0.0282   0.5345
H   -0.4993  -0.8287   1.1714
H   -0.4235   0.9513   1.1064
O   -0.9394   0.0157  -0.6674
H   -1.8540   0.0626  -0.4252
$end

$rem
   JOBTYPE   opt
   METHOD    b3lyp
   BASIS    6-31G*
$end

